OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells this evening, allowing
OL,7,Ftemperatures to dip below freezing and
OL,8,Ffor a frost to return overnight,
OL,9,Fthough slightly milder than last
OL,10,Fnight. However, cloud will thicken
OL,11,Finto the early hours from the west.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FRather cloudy on Sunday with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of light rain at first. This
OL,15,Frain turning heavier and more
OL,16,Fpersistent through midday before
OL,17,Fturning showery. Feeling rather chilly
OL,18,Fand unpleasant.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
