OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,6,Fbrighter day on Monday with sunny
OL,7,Fspells developing. Rain arrives later,
OL,8,Fturning heavier and more persistent
OL,9,Fovernight. Sunny spells inbetween
OL,10,Fscattered showers trough Tuesday into
OL,11,FWednesday.
